  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Finely chop brown onion and garlic.\n• Heat a large saucepan over medium-high heat with a good drizzle of olive oil. Cook plant-based mince, sliced mushrooms and onion, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic and herb & mushroom seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185b080e0f84c774d3c03/step-aaad0e00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add light cooking cream, the boiling water (13/4 cups for 2 people / 31/2 cups for 4 people), the vegetable stock powder and orecchiette. Stir to combine and bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to medium and cover with a lid. Cook, stirring occasionally, until the pasta is 'al dente', 11 minutes.\n• Stir through Parmesan cheese. Season with salt and pepper to taste.\n• TIP: Add a dash more water if the pasta is looking dry!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185b080e0f84c774d3c03/step-71907710.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While pasta is cooking, thinly slice pear.\n• To a medium bowl, add a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil.\n• Top dressing with mixed salad leaves and pear. Season and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185b080e0f84c774d3c03/step-b4ce6b20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide one-pot garlicky mushroom and plant-based mince orecchiette between bowls.\n• Serve with green salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185b080e0f84c774d3c03/step-a38e6030.jpg"
    }
  ]
